  "title": "Chromatic number of $\\frac{3}{3}$-power of graph",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $G$ be a graph and $m,n\\in \\mathbb{N}$. The graph $G^{\\frac{m}{n}}$ is defined to be the $m$-power of the $n$-subdivision of $G$. In other words, $G^{\\frac{m}{n}}=(G^{\\frac{1}{n}})^m$.\n\nConjecture Let $G$ be a graph with $\\Delta(G)\\geq 2$. Then $\\chi(G^{\\frac{3}{3}})\\leq 2\\Delta(G)+1$.",
